; STC32G12K128: Flash 128K at FE:0000-FF:FFFF, code linked at FF:0000/FF:0200.
; All code and constants live in program Flash; the probe keeps every mutable
; byte at fixed EDATA addresses (0x0030..0x0039) and never defines a C global,
; so there is no XINIT / CRT data copy and ISEG/BSEG stay unused.
;
; EDATA on this part is 4K (00:0000-00:0FFF); the C stack starts at 0x0800 and
; grows up into 0x0FFF.  0x0000..0x001F is the register bank and 0x0020..0x002F
; is the bit-addressable area, so the observation slots sit at 0x0030 upward.
-mwx
-i @OUTPUT_IHX@
-b HOME = 0xff0000
-b CSEG = 0xff0200
-b ISEG = 0x0000
-b BSEG = 0x0000
@PROBE_REL@
@MAIN_REL@
-e
